Third-party material
--------------------

This is a systematic review. Every extracted study value in data/extraction_master.csv and
data/poolable_dataset.csv was taken from a published third-party article,
and each row names its source study. For every value entered in a
meta-analysis, the page_cite column of data/poolable_dataset.csv records the
page or table locator in the source article. The studies that were not pooled
are identified by study label, journal and year, without a locator.

The extraction, the risk-of-bias judgements and the compilation as a whole are
the author's own work and are covered by the CC BY 4.0 grant above. The
underlying articles remain the copyright of their respective publishers. They
are identified by study label, year and journal, and no article file is distributed in this
repository.
